12. PERFORMANCE AND GRAPHICS QUALITY TIERS
========================================================

Create a centralized graphics configuration system.

HIGH:
- Enhanced shadows
- Richer particles
- Full appropriate postprocessing
- Higher resolution
- Longer LOD distances
- Greater environmental detail

MEDIUM:
- Reduced shadow resolution
- Moderate particles
- Selected postprocessing
- Adaptive pixel ratio
- Balanced LOD distances

LOW:
- Minimal expensive postprocessing
- Reduced particles
- Simplified shadow strategy
- Lower rendering resolution
- Aggressive LOD and instancing
- Reduced dynamic-light complexity

Preserve the visual identity across all tiers.

The low profile must still look like the same professionally designed game.

Provide automatic selection and allow manual override where practical.

